@startuml estados-kyc
hide empty description
skinparam linetype spline
skinparam ArrowFontSize 9
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 38
[*] --> not_started
not_started --> pending : POST /kyc/session\\n(teléfono verificado)
pending --> approved : webhook Didit\\n«Approved»
pending --> rejected : webhook Didit\\n«Declined»
pending --> manual_review : webhook Didit\\n«In Review»
rejected --> pending : reintento
manual_review --> pending : reintento
state approved <<activo>>
approved --> [*]
@enduml
